Requirement Analysis

Functional Requirements

- The system should allow users to submit support tickets.
- The system should accept the ticket description.
- The system should process the submitted ticket.
- The system should classify the ticket into an appropriate category.
- The system should display the predicted category.
- The system should store ticket details if required.

Non-Functional Requirements

- The system should be easy to use.
- The system should provide quick results.
- The system should be reliable.
- The system should maintain data security.
- The system should be scalable for handling multiple tickets.

Software Requirements

- Python
- Machine Learning
- Natural Language Processing (NLP)
- VS Code or Jupyter Notebook
- Python Libraries
- Database (if required)

Hardware Requirements

- Laptop or Desktop Computer
- Minimum 4 GB RAM
- Internet Connection
- Basic storage space for project files
